sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports Bidirectional Power Transfer
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: trigger CSMS to set a TxDefaultProfile, Relative Charging Profile<br>with chargingSchedulePeriod with operationMode ExternalLimit

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (TxDefaultProfile, Relative, operationMode = ExternalLimits)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 1): SetChargingProfileRequest<br>- evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>- chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>- chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind Relative<br>- chargingProfile.dynUpdateTime must be <omitted><br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].operationMode must be ExternalLimits<br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].limit must be <not omitted><br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].setpoint must be <omitted>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: trigger CSMS to set a TxDefaultProfile, Dynamic Charging Profile<br>with chargingSchedulePeriod with operationMode ExternalLimit

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (TxDefaultProfile, Dynamic, operationMode = ExternalLimits)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 3): SetChargingProfileRequest<br>- evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>- chargingProfile[0].chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>- chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind Dynamic<br>- chargingProfile.dynUpdateTime must be <Datetime of moment of step 3><br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].operationMode must be ExternalLimits<br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].limit must be <not omitted><br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[*].chargingSchedulePeriod[*].setpoint must be <omitted><br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[0].chargingSchedulePeriod size must be 1<br>- chargingProfile.chargingSchedule[0].chargingSchedulePeriod[0].startPeriod must be 0
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
